8a99487bbe6796e722e40465077b783341b (server-side-verified fast-forward from 839edd27ccc7...), landed via merge commit 816a4402e8f5a6ea63f57f119b402b48df34c8fc\" :regulatory-dossiers [\"docs/regulatory/india-cdsco-dossier.md\" \"docs/regulatory/gcc-gso-dossier.md\" \"docs/regulatory/asean-cosmetic-dossier.md\" \"docs/regulatory/README.md\"] :dossier-status \"DRAFT/TEMPLATE, unfiled, not legal advice\" :status \"superseded by MES/regulatory/sales extension (11 ops, 38 HARD checks) + shared-infrastructure rewire -- see Closing II / :closing-ii-manifest-registration; this GMP/CoA model itself remains real and unchanged, just no longer the newest layer\" :pin-regression-note \"the west-pin-status above (420258a9..., merge 816a4402e8f5...) genuinely landed on main at the time (confirmed via gh api compare), but was later silently reverted back to 839edd27ccc7... by an unrelated wholesale west.yml regeneration in commit 05cc1687da30 (chore(manifest): register fengshen-ember + ADR-2607183000) -- a live instance of the pin-regression-trap CLAUDE.md warns about. See :closing-ii-manifest-registration for the fix.\"}, :cfd-companion-repo {:repo \"kotoba-lang/kami-app-hygaccess-plant\" :url \"https://github.com/kotoba-lang/kami-app-hygaccess-plant\" :west-name \"kami-app-hygaccess-plant\" :pin \"48c6265245f2b2a1363b7baf32f6c9aad5074098\" :visibility :public :license \"Apache-2.0\" :ci \"green on JDK 17 + JDK 21\" :test-results \"22 tests, 63 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors\" :solver \"kotoba-lang/nagare finite-volume incompressible-Navier-Stokes + scalar-transport, dispatched via kotoba-lang/kami-engine-cae-solver's shared solve multimethod contract\" :physical-result \"PISO converges agitator-driven closed-cavity flow in 318 steps (max Courant ~0.35); transient scalar-mixing loop drives mixing-homogeneity-cov-pct monotonically from ~331.66% to ~1.83e-5%, volume-average landing at 1.0000000000019% vs 1.0% target, mass-conservation defect ~1e-12, bit-for-bit deterministic across