iew->approved, :rejected/:withdrawn reachable from any non-terminal stage)\" :reuse-proof \"second-domain test using a fictional FAA drone-airspace-waiver scenario, unrelated to hygiene products\" :test-results \"14 tests, 66 assertions, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 lint errors\" :adoption-invited-not-yet-migrated [\"cloud-itonami-isic-2023\" \"cloud-itonami-isic-2029\"] :visibility-confirmation \"flagged by a security check for creating new public-repo surface without prior explicit owner confirmation on that specific point; owner was asked directly and confirmed keep it public before this registration phase -- a confirmed decision, not an open issue\"}, :products [{:id \"int.hygaccess.water-purification-drops\" :active :sodium-hypochlorite :concentration-pct 1.0 :packaging :small-bottle-50ml :price-usdc 0.35 :ceiling-usdc 0.50 :target-countries [\"IN\" \"BD\" \"PK\" \"ID\" \"PH\"] :approved [\"IN\" \"BD\" \"ID\" \"PH\"] :pending [\"PK\"] :channels [:ngo-who-program :government-procurement]} {:id \"int.hygaccess.surface-disinfectant\" :active :sodium-hypochlorite :concentration-pct 0.1 :packaging :small-bottle-100ml :price-usdc 0.70 :ceiling-usdc 1.00 :target-countries [\"IN\" \"SA\" \"AE\" \"EG\"] :approved [\"IN\" \"SA\" \"AE\"] :pending [\"EG\"] :channels [:licensed-informal-retail-aggregator :institutional-bulk]} {:id \"int.hygaccess.antibacterial-soap-bar\" :active :isopropylmethylphenol :concentration-pct 0.15 :packaging :sachet :price-usdc 0.15 :ceiling-usdc 0.30 :target-countries [\"IN\" \"BD\" \"PK\" \"ID\" \"PH\" \"EG\"] :approved [\"IN\" \"BD\" \"ID\" \"PH\"] :pending [\"PK\" \"EG\"] :channels [:microfinance-social-enterprise :licensed-informal-retail-aggregator]} {:id \"int.hygaccess.antibacterial-liquid-soap\" :active :isopropylmethylphenol :concentration-pct 0.2 :packaging :small-bottle-50ml :price-usdc 0.25 :ceiling-usdc 0.30 :target-countries [\"IN\" \"BD\" \"PK\" \"ID\" \"PH\"] :approved [\"IN\" \"BD\" \"ID\" \"PH\"] :pending [\"PK\"] :channels [:microfinance-social-enterprise :licensed-informal-retail-aggregator]}], :origin-gap \"identified in ADR-2607113000 (2026-07-10): etzhayyim/com-etzhayyim-yakushi formulates sodium hypochlorite but has no IPMP SKU and no market/GTM layer at all; cloud-itonami-isic-2023 is a generic soap/detergent plant coordinator with no active-ingredient-level formulation or market targeting -- no actor anywhere in the fleet commercialized these two actives for water-scarce/poor-sanitation markets before this build\", :scope-excluded [\"real LLM production endpoint config\" \"RAD identity registration\" \"real distribution-partner contracts\" \"real regulatory-authority submissions (India CDSCO/BIS, GCC conformity bodies, ASEAN member-state regulators)\" \"literal real-world sales/payment/logistics execution\"], :manifest-registration \"orgs/cloud-itonami/cloud-itonami-hygiene-access added to manifest/repos.edn :extra-projects (1 insertion/1 deletion minimal diff); manifest/west.yml regenerated with --entry cloud-itonami-hygiene-access (6 insertions/1 deletion, including a pre-existing trailing-newline normalization) via a --depth 1 shallow clone of the repo used solely so gen-west-manifest.cljs's working-head detection could read the pinned commit; server-side pin verification (scripts/verify-west-pins.cljs, --entry scoped) passed for this new entry (\\\"pin 839edd27ccc7 は main から到達可能\\\"); --check reports STALE in this worktree due to unrelated pre-existing wholesale drift (a handful of other locally-cloned projects' working-tree HEADs disagreeing with their west.yml pins, plus main's own west.yml already being wholesale-stale from other concurrent sessions' registrations) -- confirmed via a throwaway full regeneration diffed against and then discarded in favor of the --entry-scoped output, so this new entry's own diff is unaffected and wholesale regeneration was not committed\", :closing-ii-manifest-registration \"cloud-itonami-hygiene-access: pin found at 839edd27ccc711abee9e9c48e71d2